    "body": "Please don't file new issues just because you disagree with a decision. Domenic asked you a specific question, namely the web platform API specification that has or needs this use case. You didn't respond to that question. Without an actual concrete use case of such an API being added to an existing or new web platform specification this isn't going to be added to WebIDL. Additions and changes to WebIDL are made in response to such actual use cases.",
